msgid "Documentation for the latest version of Qiskit propagated noise absorption"
msgstr "Dokumentasyon para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Qiskit propagated noise absorption"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA)"
msgstr "Propagated noise absorption (PNA)"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"
msgstr "Propagated noise absorption (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package implements propagated noise absorption (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) for mitigating errors in the expectation value of observables.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapatupad ng package na ito ang propagated noise absorption (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) para i-mitigate ang mga error sa expectation value ng mga observable.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA works by “absorbing” the inverses of the learned noise channels into a target observable using Pauli propagation. That is, each Pauli noise generator in the noise model is classically propagated to the end of the circuit and applied to the observable. This results in a new observable that, when measured on a QPU, mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "Gumagana ang PNA sa pamamagitan ng “pagsipsip” sa mga inverse ng natutunang noise channel papasok sa target na observable gamit ang Pauli propagation. Ibig sabihin, ang bawat Pauli noise generator sa noise model ay klasikal na ipinapalaganap hanggang sa dulo ng circuit at inilalapat sa observable. Nagreresulta ito sa bagong observable na, kapag sinukat sa QPU, ay nagmi-mitigate sa natutunang gate noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package is suitable for estimating expectation values of general quantum circuits and Pauli observables; however, the technique is generally most effective on circuits that are near-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Angkop ang package na ito para sa pagtantya ng mga expectation value ng pangkalahatang quantum circuit at Pauli observable; gayunpaman, kadalasang pinakaepektibo ang teknik sa mga circuit na near-Clifford.\n"

